# 91 chp_foldertag 1.0.0 from nextcloud-chp-35.0.3-2.chp (fail closed on ANY error), iso5-docs, 2026-11-13 (Plan 2 Task 3 review fix)
# Why: NextCloud 35.0.3 OC_Hook::emit catches Throwable from hook handlers and lets the operation proceed; only
# AbortedEventException stops it. Release 1 caught only PolicyError, so e.g. AppConfigTypeConflictException let a
# CUI copy/move out through (review finding; the pre-fix escape was NOT re-run here).
